166
01:21:00.818 --> 01:21:02.818
To check.

167
01:21:02.818 --> 01:21:05.818
Am I still engaged with God?

168
01:21:05.818 --> 01:21:08.818
When I ask someone.

169
01:21:08.818 --> 01:21:11.818
How is your relationship with God?

170
01:21:11.818 --> 01:21:14.818
And I often ask that question.

171
01:21:14.818 --> 01:21:16.818
Because I have made an agreement with myself.

172
01:21:16.818 --> 01:21:18.818
This is an important question.

173
01:21:18.818 --> 01:21:20.818
From brother to brother.

174
01:21:20.818 --> 01:21:22.818
From sister to sister.

175
01:21:22.818 --> 01:21:23.818
We can all talk.

176
01:21:23.818 --> 01:21:24.818
And how is your work going?

177
01:21:24.818 --> 01:21:25.818
And how are your children?

178
01:21:25.818 --> 01:21:26.818
Ah nice. And is he still doing well?

179
01:21:26.818 --> 01:21:27.818
All nice.

180
01:21:27.818 --> 01:21:29.818
Do you know what an important question is?

181
01:21:29.818 --> 01:21:31.818
Brother to brother, sister to sister.

182
01:21:31.818 --> 01:21:34.818
How is your relationship with God?

183
01:21:34.818 --> 01:21:38.818
The rest doesn't really interest me that much.

184
01:21:38.818 --> 01:21:41.818
But how is your relationship with God?

185
01:21:41.818 --> 01:21:44.818
And sometimes we feel a bit awkward to ask that.

186
01:21:44.818 --> 01:21:46.818
Because then we see someone.

187
01:21:46.818 --> 01:21:49.818
Who may not be fully walking with the Lord.

188
01:21:49.818 --> 01:21:52.818
And then we feel a bit awkward to ask that.

189
01:21:52.818 --> 01:21:55.818
We actually don't want to push boundaries.

190
01:21:55.818 --> 01:21:57.818
We actually don't want to be too intrusive for people.

191
01:21:57.818 --> 01:21:59.818
