192
01:21:59.818 --> 01:22:03.818
How is it with you and the Good Father in heaven?

193
01:22:03.818 --> 01:22:05.818
And I have made an agreement with myself.

194
01:22:05.818 --> 01:22:07.818
That no matter how it goes with people.

195
01:22:07.818 --> 01:22:09.818
I make it a sport in my life.

196
01:22:09.818 --> 01:22:10.818
I just ask it.

197
01:22:10.818 --> 01:22:12.818
How is it with you and the Lord?

198
01:22:12.818 --> 01:22:14.818
How is it with your relationship and God?

199
01:22:14.818 --> 01:22:15.818
And when I ask that.

200
01:22:15.818 --> 01:22:17.818
And I want to motivate everyone in the church.

201
01:22:17.818 --> 01:22:20.818
Let us be brothers and sisters to one another.

202
01:22:20.818 --> 01:22:22.818
Who do not keep bothering each other every time.

203
01:22:22.818 --> 01:22:24.818
Of I think you should do this.

204
01:22:24.818 --> 01:22:26.818
For that is condemnation.

205
01:22:26.818 --> 01:22:28.818
Let us not judge each other.

206
01:22:28.818 --> 01:22:31.818
But let us simply ask each other the reflective question.

207
01:22:31.818 --> 01:22:34.818
How are you doing with the Good Father in heaven?

208
01:22:34.818 --> 01:22:36.818
Are you still talking to the King?

209
01:22:36.818 --> 01:22:37.818
Do you still love the Lord?

210
01:22:37.818 --> 01:22:39.818
Oh yes, says Rudy.

211
01:22:39.818 --> 01:22:41.818
Are you still engaged with Him?

212
01:22:41.818 --> 01:22:44.818
For that is indeed a reflective question.

213
01:22:44.818 --> 01:22:46.818
And if all is well, that checklist should come up.

214
01:22:46.818 --> 01:22:49.818
If that person still has the Holy Spirit in their heart.

215
01:22:49.818 --> 01:22:52.818
If all is well, that checklist should indeed come up.

216
01:22:52.818 --> 01:22:54.818
Of yes, am I actually busy with the Lord?

217
01:22:54.818 --> 01:22:58.818
We are talking about being saved and not being saved.

218
01:22:58.818 --> 01:23:00.818
It is not wishy-washy like.

219
01:23:00.818 --> 01:23:02.818
Oh yes, did you say hello to the Lord?

220
01:23:02.818 --> 01:23:03.818
Yes, actually not.

221
01:23:03.818 --> 01:23:05.818
Oh yes, fine. Alright then.

222
01:23:05.818 --> 01:23:06.818
It is not fine.

223
01:23:06.818 --> 01:23:07.818
We are talking about heaven and hell here.

224
01:23:07.818 --> 01:23:10.818
We are talking about being saved and not being saved.

225
01:23:10.818 --> 01:23:12.818
