226
01:23:12.818 --> 01:23:14.818
If you do not live in the truth of the Lord.

227
01:23:14.818 --> 01:23:16.818
You live in the lie of the world.

228
01:23:16.818 --> 01:23:17.818
It is one of the two.

229
01:23:17.818 --> 01:23:19.818
There is no gray with the Lord. Amen.

230
01:23:20.818 --> 01:23:27.818
And so what I want to show today, what I also read in the whole book of Ezra,

231
01:23:27.818 --> 01:23:30.818
is that there is a checklist.

232
01:23:30.818 --> 01:23:35.818
I told you a few weeks ago that the Bible is written,

233
01:23:35.818 --> 01:23:41.818
that Biblios, that Biblia is written in different genres.

234
01:23:41.818 --> 01:23:42.818
You remember that, right?

235
01:23:42.818 --> 01:23:48.818
And I told you that Ezra is written in the narrative genre.

236
01:23:48.818 --> 01:23:51.818
Narrative means story.

237
01:23:51.818 --> 01:24:01.818
And sometimes, sometimes we confuse the word story with the word history.

238
01:24:01.818 --> 01:24:08.818
And narrative and history are related, but they are not the same.

239
01:24:08.818 --> 01:24:14.818
History means, then this happened, and that is that, and that is that.

240
01:24:14.818 --> 01:24:18.818
History is about being factual over history.

241
01:24:18.818 --> 01:24:19.818
That is history.

242
01:24:19.818 --> 01:24:22.818
Narrative is story.

243
01:24:22.818 --> 01:24:28.818
And history is part of the story, but is not the story itself.

244
01:24:28.818 --> 01:24:30.818
Do you understand what I mean?

245
01:24:30.818 --> 01:24:32.818
Yes? Yes?

246
01:24:34.818 --> 01:24:36.818
Why am I explaining this?

247
01:24:36.818 --> 01:24:42.818
When the Bible writers were working with the genre of narrative,

248
01:24:42.818 --> 01:24:48.818
they were writing a story that was based on history.

249
01:24:48.818 --> 01:24:51.818
Because it often had to do with dates and lists of names.

250
01:24:51.818 --> 01:24:54.818
So it was historically factual to some extent.

251
01:24:54.818 --> 01:24:58.818
Only they had, when the Bible was written,

252
01:24:58.818 --> 01:25:03.818
