758
01:53:50.818 --> 01:53:52.818
Glory to the Lord.

759
01:53:52.818 --> 01:53:54.818
For the grace in my life.

760
01:53:54.818 --> 01:53:57.818
The restoration of God in my life.

761
01:53:57.818 --> 01:53:59.818
What I have now in my life.

762
01:53:59.818 --> 01:54:03.818
My beautiful wife, my beautiful children, my house.

763
01:54:03.818 --> 01:54:05.818
You, my true friends.

764
01:54:05.818 --> 01:54:08.818
Those people in the world were not my friends at all, man.

765
01:54:08.818 --> 01:54:11.818
As soon as I said I wanted to stop those stupid things I was doing.

766
01:54:11.818 --> 01:54:14.818
I immediately got WhatsApp messages that I was a loser.

767
01:54:14.818 --> 01:54:15.818
Those were not friends.

768
01:54:15.818 --> 01:54:17.818
You are my friends.

769
01:54:17.818 --> 01:54:20.818
I hope so.

770
01:54:20.818 --> 01:54:22.818
But I have nothing of my own.

771
01:54:22.818 --> 01:54:27.818
I hope everyone in this room adopts the same attitude.

772
01:54:27.818 --> 01:54:29.818
You have nothing of your own.

773
01:54:29.818 --> 01:54:32.818
The organs in your body do not belong to you at all.

774
01:54:32.818 --> 01:54:35.818
The Creator made those, you may borrow them.

775
01:54:35.818 --> 01:54:38.818
So everything, everything, everything is the grace of the Lord.

776
01:54:38.818 --> 01:54:41.818
The job you have, the marriage you have, the children you have.

777
01:54:41.818 --> 01:54:43.818
The stewardship for money.

778
01:54:43.818 --> 01:54:45.818
It all belongs to the Lord.

779
01:54:45.818 --> 01:54:50.818
And if you live with the Lord, as Ezra does in verse 6.

780
01:54:50.818 --> 01:54:53.818
If you live with the Lord, and what does it say then?

781
01:54:53.818 --> 01:54:57.818
The Lord was with Ezra.

782
01:54:57.818 --> 01:55:01.818
You can discover who you are here.

783
01:55:02.818 --> 01:55:04.818
Here you discover who you are.

784
01:55:04.818 --> 01:55:07.818
In worship and in the Word.

785
01:55:07.818 --> 01:55:10.818
There you discover who you are.

786
01:55:10.818 --> 01:55:12.818
There you discover your identity.

787
01:55:12.818 --> 01:55:14.818
From God's Word.

788
01:55:14.818 --> 01:55:18.818
If he may speak to you, then he will call you by your name.

789
01:55:18.818 --> 01:55:22.818
And then he will tell you what you must do in his kingdom.

790
01:55:22.818 --> 01:55:26.818
And then you can begin to identify yourself with God.

791
01:55:26.818 --> 01:55:29.818
And you can say, you are my Lord.

792
01:55:29.818 --> 01:55:32.818
And then he is also with you.

793
01:55:32.818 --> 01:55:33.818
Whatever you do.

794
01:55:33.818 --> 01:55:36.818
Through whatever situation you go.

795
01:55:37.818 --> 01:55:38.818
Verse 7.

796
01:55:38.818 --> 01:55:42.818
With him went a group of Israelites.

797
01:55:42.818 --> 01:55:46.818
