798
01:55:46.818 --> 01:55:49.818
Thus he departed for Jerusalem.

799
01:55:49.818 --> 01:55:52.818
Artaxerxes had been king for seven years at that time.

800
01:55:52.818 --> 01:55:57.818
In the fifth month of that same year, Ezra arrived in Jerusalem.

801
01:55:58.818 --> 01:56:01.818
I see that, very cinematically I see that before me.

802
01:56:01.818 --> 01:56:03.818
So he arrived in Jerusalem.

803
01:56:03.818 --> 01:56:07.818
He had departed from Babylon on the first day of the first month.

804
01:56:07.818 --> 01:56:11.818
On the first day of the fifth month, he arrived in Jerusalem.

805
01:56:11.818 --> 01:56:13.818
I had underlined verse 10.

806
01:56:13.818 --> 01:56:16.818
God was with him.

807
01:56:16.818 --> 01:56:17.818
Do you see that?

808
01:56:17.818 --> 01:56:19.818
God was with him.

809
01:56:19.818 --> 01:56:21.818
Why was God with him?

810
01:56:21.818 --> 01:56:24.818
Because in the relationship there is always a if-then.

811
01:56:24.818 --> 01:56:27.818
Fair is fair. If-then is also fair.

812
01:56:27.818 --> 01:56:31.818
Very often we expect from Jesus that it is not an if-then.

813
01:56:31.818 --> 01:56:33.818
That we say, everything must come from Jesus.

814
01:56:33.818 --> 01:56:35.818
Nothing comes from me of what I just said.

815
01:56:35.818 --> 01:56:39.818
But how fair is it to build an if-then into a relationship?

816
01:56:39.818 --> 01:56:42.818
If you love God, he will always be with you.

817
01:56:42.818 --> 01:56:45.818
If you obey his Word, he can protect you.

818
01:56:45.818 --> 01:56:48.818
If you love him, he can bless you.

819
01:56:48.818 --> 01:56:50.818
If you ask him for help, he can guide you.

820
01:56:50.818 --> 01:56:53.818
If-then.

821
01:56:53.818 --> 01:57:01.818
Verse 10. God was with him because Ezra was determined to study the law of God.

822
01:57:01.818 --> 01:57:04.818
Listen carefully to what this verse says.

823
01:57:04.818 --> 01:57:08.818
It does not say what we are about to read,

824
01:57:08.818 --> 01:57:14.818
that Ezra was determined to tell the people what they should do according to the law of Moses.

825
01:57:14.818 --> 01:57:16.818
It does not say that.

826
01:57:16.818 --> 01:57:22.818
It says, God was with him because Ezra was determined to study the law of God.

827
01:57:22.818 --> 01:57:25.818
And to live according to that law.

828
01:57:25.818 --> 01:57:28.818
Do you see that?

829
01:57:28.818 --> 01:57:35.818
Ezra was determined to live according to the law of God.

830
01:57:35.818 --> 01:57:37.818
That is where it begins.

831
01:57:37.818 --> 01:57:41.818
It starts with yourself.

832
01:57:41.818 --> 01:57:43.818
Period.

833
01:57:43.818 --> 01:57:49.818
And also because he wanted to teach the people of Israel to live according to the law of God.

834
01:57:50.818 --> 01:57:53.818
It starts with yourself.

835
01:57:53.818 --> 01:57:58.818
There are two types of ways you can lead in life.

836
01:57:58.818 --> 01:58:01.818
I learned these two lessons once in my life.

837
01:58:01.818 --> 01:58:03.818
I will say them in English for a moment.

838
01:58:03.818 --> 01:58:07.818
You can lead by delegation.

839
01:58:07.818 --> 01:58:11.818
Or you can lead by example.

840
01:58:11.818 --> 01:58:16.818
Leading by example is the only way.

841
01:58:16.818 --> 01:58:18.818
There is no other.

842
01:58:18.818 --> 01:58:22.818
Leading by delegation is telling people what they should do.

843
01:58:22.818 --> 01:58:24.818
You must live like this.

844
01:58:24.818 --> 01:58:25.818
You must do this.

845
01:58:25.818 --> 01:58:27.818
You must adhere to the laws of Moses.

846
01:58:27.818 --> 01:58:29.818
You must behave like this.

847
01:58:29.818 --> 01:58:31.818
You must say sorry to God.

848
01:58:31.818 --> 01:58:33.818
You must give money to the church.

849
01:58:33.818 --> 01:58:34.818
You must do this.

850
01:58:34.818 --> 01:58:35.818
You must do that.

851
01:58:35.818 --> 01:58:37.818
That is delegation.

852
01:58:37.818 --> 01:58:39.818
Hey you, come here for a moment.

853
01:58:39.818 --> 01:58:40.818
Can you do this and that for me?

854
01:58:40.818 --> 01:58:43.818
Just go ahead and do that...

855
01:58:43.818 --> 01:58:45.818
That is delegation.

856
01:58:45.818 --> 01:58:46.818
Do you know what that is?

857
01:58:46.818 --> 01:58:47.818
That is annoying.

858
01:58:47.818 --> 01:58:49.818
Everyone finds that annoying.

859
01:58:49.818 --> 01:58:51.818
Do you know why that is annoying?

860
01:58:51.818 --> 01:58:53.818
Because it is annoying.

861
01:58:53.818 --> 01:58:55.818
And you feel that.

862
01:58:55.818 --> 01:58:58.818
You just feel it in your flesh.

863
01:58:58.818 --> 01:59:01.818
And that is not necessarily a demon.

864
01:59:01.818 --> 01:59:04.818
But it is just annoying when someone acts like that.

865
01:59:04.818 --> 01:59:08.818
