869
01:59:19.818 --> 01:59:22.818
Then that is because he has gone before you.

870
01:59:22.818 --> 01:59:24.818
In building a company.

871
01:59:24.818 --> 01:59:27.818
So never be arrogant about the boss in your company.

872
01:59:27.818 --> 01:59:32.818
For the boss in your company has worked 80 hours for many years.

873
01:59:32.818 --> 01:59:34.818
To build the company where you are now allowed to work.

874
01:59:34.818 --> 01:59:36.818
Everything is grace from the Lord.

875
01:59:36.818 --> 01:59:39.818
Be good to the boss at your work and he can bless you.

876
01:59:39.818 --> 01:59:40.818
Amen.

