930
02:02:21.818 --> 02:02:23.818
Determined.

931
02:02:23.818 --> 02:02:26.818
Then all sorts of things can happen in my life.

932
02:02:26.818 --> 02:02:32.818
But because of my determination, I will always keep going.

933
02:02:32.818 --> 02:02:35.818
So if I in my flesh a...

