02:02:52.818 --> 02:02:56.818
Yes, but I have dedicated this and that, but that did not happen then.

941
02:02:56.818 --> 02:02:58.818
And I find it boring.

942
02:02:58.818 --> 02:03:00.818
And I don't like this.

