1000
02:05:50.818 --> 02:05:53.818
This is our flesh. I am also talking about myself.

1001
02:05:53.818 --> 02:05:56.818
That is inherent in our flesh. That is the fact.

1002
02:05:56.818 --> 02:06:02.818
But if I, lead by example, if we look once more at verse 10.

