Will you lead me through this difficult situation?

1016
02:06:39.818 --> 02:06:41.818
Lord, will you help me?

1017
02:06:41.818 --> 02:06:45.818
Then my faith is autonomous.

1018
02:06:45.818 --> 02:06:48.818
And you need an autonomous faith.

1019
02:06:48.818 --> 02:06:56.818
You need it so that if everything around you were to fall away, you would still stand.

1020
02:06:56.818 --> 02:06:59.818
Here is a reflection question.

1021
02:06:59.818 --> 02:07:03.818
What do you actually need to believe in God?

1022
02:07:03.818 --> 02:07:08.818
How would you feel if we stopped making music for a year?

1023
02:07:08.818 --> 02:07:10.818
Just nothing.

1024
02:07:10.818 --> 02:07:13.818
Just like just now at a quarter to ten on the stage.

1025
02:07:13.818 --> 02:07:16.818
Caroline, Ben, just do nothing for a moment. No music for a bit.

1026
02:07:16.818 --> 02:07:19.818
Lights on, no colored lights, nothing.

1027
02:07:19.818 --> 02:07:22.818
Absolutely nothing. Just there, I have a few of those fluorescent tubes.

1028
02:07:22.818 --> 02:07:24.818
Lights on, nothing.

1029
02:07:24.818 --> 02:07:26.818
Silence.

1030
02:07:26.818 --> 02:07:28.818
Yes, then I find it boring.

1031
02:07:28.818 --> 02:07:30.818
So then I'm out.

1032
02:07:30.818 --> 02:07:34.818
Is that determination of God's Word?

1033
02:07:34.818 --> 02:07:36.818
No.

1034
02:07:36.818 --> 02:07:40.818
That we are determined in whatever capacity we are.

1035
02:07:40.818 --> 02:07:43.818
That we are engaged with Him.

1036
02:07:43.818 --> 02:07:46.818
Verse 27. We can jump further. I'm going to stop with it.

1037
02:07:46.818 --> 02:07:49.818
Verse 27. A doxology.

1038
02:07:49.818 --> 02:07:51.818
What I talked about a few weeks ago.

1039
02:07:51.818 --> 02:07:53.818
Here is a doxology from Ezra.

1040
02:07:53.818 --> 02:07:56.818
Shall we stand? Because I see that it is already five past half.

1041
02:07:56.818 --> 02:07:59.818
I will just stop. Shall we stand up?

1042
02:08:00.818 --> 02:08:03.818
In verse 27 there is a doxology.

1043
02:08:03.818 --> 02:08:06.818
And that doxology from Ezra goes as follows.

1044
02:08:06.818 --> 02:08:10.818
Stretch out for a moment. Then we will do this doxology.

1045
02:08:10.818 --> 02:08:12.818
Ezra says the following words.

1046
02:08:12.818 --> 02:08:17.818
Praise the Lord, the God of our ancestors, that he has ensured...

1047
02:08:17.818 --> 02:08:22.818
...that the king was willing to cooperate in the rebuilding of the temple of the Lord in Jerusalem.

1048
02:08:22.818 --> 02:08:26.818
Praise the Lord, that he has ensured...

1049
02:08:26.818 --> 02:08:29.818
Praise the Lord, that he has ensured...

1050
02:08:29.818 --> 02:08:33.818
...that the king, his advisors, and all the ministers wanted to listen to me...

1051
02:08:33.818 --> 02:08:36.818
...and gave me everything I asked for.

1052
02:08:36.818 --> 02:08:41.818
Because I noticed that my Lord was determined, no matter what anyone thinks...

1053
02:08:41.818 --> 02:08:44.818
...this is my Lord. Draw God to you.

1054
02:08:44.818 --> 02:08:48.818
Checklist, do you read the Bible? Checklist, do you worship God?

1055
02:08:48.818 --> 02:08:50.818
Then he is your God.

1056
02:08:50.818 --> 02:08:56.818
Because I noticed that my Lord God was with me, I gained courage.

1057
02:08:56.818 --> 02:09:00.818
Here is my last lesson, as I want to pray for you shortly.

1058
02:09:00.818 --> 02:09:03.818
Have courage in the Lord. Gather your courage from him.

1059
02:09:03.818 --> 02:09:06.818
You must gather your courage from the Lord.

1060
02:09:06.818 --> 02:09:10.818
To worship him, to be who you are in God's kingdom.

1061
02:09:10.818 --> 02:09:13.818
Even if I would wither away in my...

1062
02:09:13.818 --> 02:09:18.818
...not self-determination, but even if I would wither away in my fear...

1063
02:09:18.818 --> 02:09:21.818
...who could I then be in God's kingdom.

1064
02:09:21.818 --> 02:09:25.818
But it is the courage that God gives me in the name of Jesus...

1065
02:09:25.818 --> 02:09:27.818
...that I can live for Him.

1066
02:09:27.818 --> 02:09:30.818
And I dared to gather the heads of families from Israel...

1067
02:09:30.818 --> 02:09:32.818
...to go with me to Jerusalem.

1068
02:09:32.818 --> 02:09:37.818
Can we close our eyes? I want to conclude the service by praying for you.

1069
02:09:39.818 --> 02:09:42.818
Dear Father in heaven, I thank you for Open Church.

1070
02:09:42.818 --> 02:09:45.818
I thank you for all the people who come to Open Church to worship you.

1071
02:09:45.818 --> 02:09:47.818
For that is where it begins.

1072
02:09:47.818 --> 02:09:50.818
Lord, I want to pray that the people who come to Open Church...

1073
02:09:50.818 --> 02:09:53.818
...for a very short time or perhaps for many years...

1074
02:09:53.818 --> 02:09:56.818
...Lord, that we come into a checklist with you...

1075
02:09:56.818 --> 02:09:58.818
...in our homework, in our prayers this coming week.

1076
02:09:58.818 --> 02:10:01.818
Lord, you are my God, I am your child.

1077
02:10:01.818 --> 02:10:04.818
I am your son, you are my Father.

1078
02:10:04.818 --> 02:10:06.818
And I want to bless everyone in the room...

1079
02:10:06.818 --> 02:10:10.818
...that we all may worship the Lord.

1080
02:10:10.818 --> 02:10:13.818
In whatever situation you find yourself.

1081
02:10:13.818 --> 02:10:15.818
Maybe you are bored with God.

1082
02:10:15.818 --> 02:10:17.818
Maybe you are angry with people.

1083
02:10:17.818 --> 02:10:20.818
Maybe you have experienced things that make you think...

1084
02:10:21.818 --> 02:10:22.818
...to worship, Lord.

1085
02:10:23.818 --> 02:10:25.818
Zerubbabel means born in misery.

1086
02:10:25.818 --> 02:10:27.818
Born in Babel.

1087
02:10:27.818 --> 02:10:29.818
But also born in Babel.

1088
02:10:29.818 --> 02:10:32.818
Even in your situation, you can worship the Lord.

1089
02:10:32.818 --> 02:10:36.818
Start to worship the Lord again in parentheses.

1090
02:10:36.818 --> 02:10:37.818
To worship, Lord.

1091
02:10:37.818 --> 02:10:39.818
Invite him into your heart.

1092
02:10:39.818 --> 02:10:41.818
While all eyes are closed.

1093
02:10:41.818 --> 02:10:44.818
I want to ask you, I want to speak to your soul.

1094
02:10:44.818 --> 02:10:46.818
Invite the Lord again.

1095
02:10:46.818 --> 02:10:48.818
Worship him again.

1096
02:10:48.818 --> 02:10:50.818
Call upon him again.

1097
02:10:50.818 --> 02:10:52.818
Yes, but Tim, I have actually made a mess of things.

1098
02:10:52.818 --> 02:10:53.818
Call upon him.

1099
02:10:54.818 --> 02:10:56.818
Yes, but Tim, I actually don't believe anymore.

1100
02:10:56.818 --> 02:10:58.818
He believes in you, call upon him.

1101
02:10:58.818 --> 02:11:00.818
Yes, but Tim, I have sinned.

1102
02:11:00.818 --> 02:11:02.818
Call upon Him, He can forgive you.

1103
02:11:02.818 --> 02:11:03.818
Yes, but Tim, I am in pain.

1104
02:11:03.818 --> 02:11:05.818
Call upon Him, He can set you free.

1105
02:11:06.818 --> 02:11:08.818
Lord, I want to pray for everyone in the room...

1106
02:11:08.818 --> 02:11:10.818
...that we will have a worshiping heart.

1107
02:11:11.818 --> 02:11:14.818
My second prayer for everyone in open church is...

1108
02:11:14.818 --> 02:11:16.818
...read God's Word.

1109
02:11:16.818 --> 02:11:18.818
I want to impress it upon your soul.

1110
02:11:18.818 --> 02:11:20.818
Driven by the Holy Spirit.

1111
02:11:20.818 --> 02:11:22.818
Read God's Word again.

1112
02:11:22.818 --> 02:11:24.818
Read one paragraph, read one chapter.

1113
02:11:24.818 --> 02:11:26.818
Give five minutes in the Word to the Lord.

1114
02:11:26.818 --> 02:11:28.818
Give ten minutes, give half an hour.

1115
02:11:28.818 --> 02:11:30.818
It doesn't matter how long.

1116
02:11:30.818 --> 02:11:32.818
But give time to the Lord in God's Word.

1117
02:11:32.818 --> 02:11:34.818
And He can feed you with His Word.

1118
02:11:34.818 --> 02:11:36.818
The daily manna that you need.

1119
02:11:37.818 --> 02:11:39.818
And so I want to bless everyone in this room.

1120
02:11:39.818 --> 02:11:41.818
That we will...

1121
02:11:41.818 --> 02:11:43.818
This is my Lord attitude will have.

1122
02:11:43.818 --> 02:11:45.818
This is my Lord.

1123
02:11:45.818 --> 02:11:47.818
And I bless us all with that.

1124
02:11:47.818 --> 02:11:49.818
In the mighty name of King Jesus.

1125
02:11:49.818 --> 02:11:50.818
Amen.

1126
02:11:50.818 --> 02:11:52.818
Amen and amen.

1127
02:11:53.818 --> 02:11:55.818
Dear people.

1128
02:11:55.818 --> 02:11:56.818
Happy Sunday.

1129
02:11:56.818 --> 02:11:59.818
New Start begins on nine three.

1130
02:11:59.818 --> 02:12:02.818
And that is both in Dutch and in English.

1131
02:12:10.818 --> 02:12:12.818
See you tomorrow.

1132
02:12:12.818 --> 02:12:14.818
Tomorrow we will pray for the countries and the nations.

1133
02:12:14.818 --> 02:12:16.818
See you tomorrow. Half past seven. Bye bye.
